ss=\"nhead\">板・売買フローの推定（AI）</div><div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(27年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><polyline points=\"4.0,97.2 9.1,92.3 14.2,90.2 19.3,88.0 24.5,92.9 29.6,89.8 34.7,88.1 39.8,86.6 44.9,80.8 50.0,80.2 55.1,80.9 60.3,69.6 65.4,70.3 70.5,78.2 75.6,64.8 80.7,52.9 85.8,51.8 91.0,52.7 96.1,48.4 101.2,56.6 106.3,66.2 111.4,58.1 116.5,61.1 121.6,58.5 126.8,48.2 131.9,53.9 137.0,59.1 142.1,76.3 147.2,72.9 152.3,73.2 157.4,69.5 162.6,60.7 167.7,78.2 172.8,82.2 177.9,85.6 183.0,75.3 188.1,84.4 193.2,78.0 198.4,69.9 203.5,71.6 208.6,66.6 213.7,67.6 218.8,65.8 223.9,57.1 229.0,73.7 234.2,71.1 239.3,67.3 244.4,65.4 249.5,63.6 254.6,63.0 259.7,69.7 264.9,66.0 270.0,60.0 275.1,68.0 280.2,77.3 285.3,73.5 290.4,65.7 295.5,65.1 300.7,62.0 305.8,37.8 310.9,19.9 316.0,12.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"12.8\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><polyline points=\"4.0,42.0 6.1,41.5 8.3,50.1 10.4,54.1 12.5,52.7 14.7,57.4 16.8,76.1 19.0,73.5 21.1,56.6 23.2,57.1 25.4,55.9 27.5,52.6 29.6,49.3 31.8,49.0 33.9,43.2 36.1,49.3 38.2,57.2 40.3,41.2 42.5,38.9 44.6,48.3 46.7,45.2 4